    "created_at": "2016-06-01T21:09:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-01T21:09:30Z",
    "body": "Some background:\n1. Nav Timing L2 is now based on Resource Timing L2 (a navigation is \"special\" resource fetch)\n2. We have an outstanding issue to redefine RT on top of Fetch: https://github.com/w3c/resource-timing/issues/39 -- realistically, this is probably an \"~L3\" feature.\n   - Once this is resolved, NT will inherit the logic as well.\n\nOnce we resolve (2), I think it makes sense to take a closer look at integration with HTML.\n",
